WEBVTT

00:02:59.177 --> 00:03:04.571
Den kan kallas Toadie, Dee Dee, Nishi,
Dignity, Coochi Snorcher,

00:03:04.571 --> 00:03:09.431
Cooter, Labbe, Gladys Seagelman, VA,

00:03:09.431 --> 00:03:13.960
Wee Wee, Horsespot, Nappy Dugout,

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:20.180
Mongo, Ghoulie, Powderbox, Mimi i Miami,

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.321
Split Knish i Philadelphia...

00:03:22.321 --> 00:03:23.442
(Skratt)

00:03:23.442 --> 00:03:25.332
och Schmende i Bronx.

00:03:25.332 --> 00:03:26.578
(Skratt)

00:03:26.578 --> 00:03:28.547
Jag oroar mig för vaginor.

00:03:29.638 --> 00:03:31.848
Så här börjar "Vaginamonologerna".